   255   *      version (1.0, 2.0, 2.1, or 3.0) of the document structuring conventions.
   256   *      It does not really care which version of comments the file contains.
   257   *      (The comments are largely upward compatible.)  It will scan a number
   258   *      of non-conforming documents.  (You could have part of the document
   259   *      conform to V2.0 and the rest conform to V3.0.  It would be similar
   260   *      to the DC-2 1/2+, it would look funny but it can still fly.)

